    "Id": "vehicledef_BANDIT_MK2",
    "Name": "Bandit Mk.2 HCV",
    "Details": "The Bandit is a 50-ton combat hovercraft, first seen in use by the Wolf’s Dragoons. Designed by the Blackwell Industries technicians who survived the Jihad's opening salvo on Outreach, the 'Warthog' trades the standard engine for an XL Engine. Heavy Ferro-Fibrous armor improves the Bandit's protection, particularly the Armored Motive System that improves the durability of the hoverskirt. A turret-mounted Machine Gun and Large Variable Speed Pulse Laser are the only weapons carried.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 9/14 hexes / 270/420 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Heavy Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       220     25\n<b>Left</b>         160     25\n<b>Right</b>       160     25\n<b>Rear</b>        160     25\n<b>Turret</b>      180     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      880    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
    "Icon": "Bandit"
  },
